# Keep image contexts lean and free of secrets / frozen HealthCare content.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.git/
**/.vs/
**/HealthCare/
**/node_modules/
**/*.user
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/artifacts/
**/TestResults/
**/*.dump
**/*.manifest.json
ops/backup/artifacts/
docs/
tests/
tools/
.cursor/
*.md
!deploy/docker/**
